JRawr Character Exporter
Copyright 2026 Adriano Botti and the JRawr contributors.

JRawr Character Exporter is a World of Warcraft 3.3.5 (Wrath of the Lich King)
addon that exports the current character setup as Rawr character XML for import
into JRawr. It is part of the JRawr project.

